### Step 2: Calculate the total equivalent resistance

The external equivalent resistance \(R_{eq, AB}\) is \(\frac{2}{3}\) \(\Omega\). The internal resistance \(r\) is also \(\frac{2}{3}\) \(\Omega\). The total equivalent resistance \(R_{total}\) of the circuit is the sum of the external equivalent resistance and the internal resistance.
